{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main8110_combat_01",
      "hash": "2862f3f0a8471eb5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "希巴「我是四天王之一的希巴！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main8110_combat_05",
      "hash": "2862eff0a84717e9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "無論是人還是寶可夢，\\n只要經歷戰鬥的磨練，\\r\\n就能使實力突破極限！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main8110_combat_06",
      "hash": "2862ecf0a84712d0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我的人生便是和\\n格鬥屬性的寶可夢們\\r\\n在不斷的磨練中一路走來！\\r\\n而今後也是如此！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main8110_combat_07",
      "hash": "2862edf0a8471483",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳叫[VAR TRNAME(0000)]是吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main8110_combat_08",
      "hash": "2862faf0a8472a9a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳就好好見識一下\\n我們的強大力量吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main8110_combat_09",
      "hash": "2862fbf0a8472c4d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呼——！喝——！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_shiba_01_p02_cave_d1402",
      "hash": "72418348ba117edb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 6]"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main8110_combat_02",
      "hash": "2862f0f0a847199c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "希巴「既然輸了，\\n我們的登場也就到此為止！\\r\\n去吧！[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳就繼續前進吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main8110_combat_03",
      "hash": "2862f1f0a8471b4f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "希巴「我在這裡也能感受到\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳與科拿對戰時那股\\r\\n銳不可擋的氣勢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main8110_combat_10",
      "hash": "2865f8f0a8495d0b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "為了回敬[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳，就讓[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳見識\\n歷經千錘百鍊的格鬥屬性寶可夢們\\r\\n那銳不可擋的實力吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main8110_combat_11",
      "hash": "2865f7f0a8495b58",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呼——！喝——！\\n呼——！！喝——！！！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main8110_combat_04",
      "hash": "2862eef0a8471636",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "可惡！\\n是我的修行還不夠嗎……\\c\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳不需要顧慮我，\\n繼續向前進吧！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_8110_max",
      "hash": "ec1bedabba5a271d"
    }
  ]
}
